  "rulings": [
    {
      "comment": "The Angel Warrior creature token enters the battlefield as a 4/4 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power or toughness enters the battlefield will see the token enter as a 4/4 creature.",
      "oracle_id": "236c4ff1-8c3f-4763-8df9-925021e65726",
      "published_at": "2021-02-05",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "You decide whether to pay {4}{W} as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. If you do, you immediately create the Angel Warrior creature token and attach Valkyrie's Sword to it. No players may respond to your decision to pay or not, and no player may take actions during this process.",
      "oracle_id": "236c4ff1-8c3f-4763-8df9-925021e65726",
      "published_at": "2021-02-05",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Creating the Thopter token and attaching Barbed Spike to it happen as part of the resolution of the same ability. There is no time for an opponent to react after the token is created but before the Equipment is attached.",
      "oracle_id": "28b22709-3e69-4eb7-8a3d-b75b6e65f30e",
      "published_at": "2021-06-18",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The token will still be created even if Barbed Spike is not able to be attached to it (perhaps because it was destroyed in response to the ability).",
      "oracle_id": "28b22709-3e69-4eb7-8a3d-b75b6e65f30e",
      "published_at": "2021-06-18",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.",
      "oracle_id": "5cfdfcac-57fb-4507-a97a-cccbac2d1327",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.",
      "oracle_id": "5cfdfcac-57fb-4507-a97a-cccbac2d1327",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.",
      "oracle_id": "5cfdfcac-57fb-4507-a97a-cccbac2d1327",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.",
      "oracle_id": "5cfdfcac-57fb-4507-a97a-cccbac2d1327",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The Dwarf Berserker creature token enters the battlefield as a 2/1 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield will see the token enter as a 2/1 creature.",
      "oracle_id": "a6365f98-f652-492b-81de-5f8cd6fe0a1c",
      "published_at": "2021-02-05",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "You decide whether to pay {2} as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. If you do, you immediately create the Dwarf Berserker creature token and attach Dwarven Hammer to it. No players may respond to your decision to pay or not, and no player may take actions during this process.",
      "oracle_id": "a6365f98-f652-492b-81de-5f8cd6fe0a1c",
      "published_at": "2021-02-05",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the Rebel is destroyed, the Equipment stays on the battlefield. Similarly, you may pay its equip cost to move it from the Rebel token to another creature you control.",
      "oracle_id": "c43b176a-9001-4fe4-bd9b-809880134067",
      "published_at": "2023-02-04",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the ability causes two Rebel tokens to be created (due to an effect such as that of Mondrak, Glory Dominus), the Equipment becomes attached to only one of them.",
      "oracle_id": "c43b176a-9001-4fe4-bd9b-809880134067",
      "published_at": "2023-02-04",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The Rebel enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature, then the Equipment becomes attached to it. Abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield see that a 2/2 creature entered the battlefield.",
      "oracle_id": "c43b176a-9001-4fe4-bd9b-809880134067",
